     The ssiimmpplleeffbb driver supports the frame buffer set up by firmware or the
     bootloader on systems that use a device tree to describe the hardware.

     The ssiimmpplleeffbb driver interfaces the frame buffer with the wscons(4) con‐
     sole framework.  It does not provide direct device driver entry points
     but makes its functions available via the internal wsdisplay(4) inter‐
     face.

